SQL> @i1
======================================
Create a partitioned table
The virtual column makes stats gather
slow if we visit every row of the table

This makes it very obvious if we use
synopses to generate global-level
statistics because the gather time
will be much lower because we won't
need to visit all of the rows in the table
======================================

