SQL> set echo off
========================================
Note the short time to process this step
indicating that we are not scanning all
rows in the table.

If the table has indexes, this step will
take longer, but we will still use
synopses to reduce the overall gather time.

For the purposes of illustration, and to make
the synopses optimization  more obvious, no indexes
in this test case.
========================================
SQL> exec dbms_stats.gather_table_stats(user,'sales_data',options=>'gather auto')

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.

Elapsed: 00:00:00.02
